00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:44.000
And then another thing, another key factor is negotiating leverage. So some PPOs will renegotiate if you can show utilization, growth, or competitive data. And there are others that don't negotiate at all.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:16:04.000
Most dental practices treat. PPO contracts as a fixed infrastructure. The way that you say, like, you treat your rent or your utilities. They renew automatically, often with no fee increase, while your overhead climbs 3 to 6% annually.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:14.000
