So our 1st question is for, um… Oh, okay, it's a fellow specialist in the room, uh, Dr. John Parnoff, uh, an owner and periodontist, is looking for the playbook. So, Dr. Parnoff asks, does the anti-PPO transition look different for specialty practice versus a general practice, and what is the first step.

