So I never worry about competition from the specialists of protecting, you know, or protecting my referral base. I figure, you know, because a lot of my patients come from patients. I think if you provide a certain quality of service and you're there.

01:39:02.000 --> 01:39:20.000
Um, you don't really have to worry about that. So I don't practice defensively. Fax is very proactively. And, um, you know, I just try to provide not the best only quality service, but the best experience for the patient, because patients don't know the difference between my implant and Parnoff's implant.

