So I think I don't think there are a lot of people out there providing really great care, not in terms of the quality of care. I'm talking about really good care and like taking care of people. You think about this, Don. Anybody here, how many restaurants do you go to over and over again because you just love it. It's a great experience.

01:40:49.000 --> 01:40:56.000
