01:42:20.000 --> 01:42:21.000
Right.

01:42:21.000 --> 01:42:29.000
Because… They're not paying attention. They don't realize how important it is. Nobody thinks about this, you know. We were talking about, what did they teach us in business and business in dental school? Right now, I don't know if you've all seen it. There's an article written. Actually, my friend, this was written about in in the Wall Street Journal about the millionaire next door, the dentists.

01:42:29.000 --> 01:42:45.000
