So we've made a decision, and I use things that are very non-computational. We've made a decision to move in a different direction, because we're going to feel it will benefit our patients. They don't know what that means, okay? But it will benefit them, because you won't be stressed, and you'll be able to provide better quality care, because you'll be able to afford a new handpiece, you know, it doesn't break every other day.

