01:51:59.000 --> 01:52:03.000
We have… when a patient comes into our practice.

01:52:03.000 --> 01:52:17.000
I make them commit to getting their teeth clean every what I think it is 3 to 4 or 5 months before I treat them. So if you're a new patient in my office, Don, at the first visit and you need a lot of work, I say, you know, I'll treat you, but you got to commit to maintaining your health.

01:52:17.000 --> 01:52:26.000
Because of my treatment, you know, is successful. You don't maintain it, you know, it's like, you know, driving an expensive car and not changing the oil.

01:52:26.000 --> 01:52:42.000
filling the gas during the maintenance will break down. So we have a very strong maintenance practice and we have um we have two or three hygienists every day in our practice. And I don't look at the hygiene practice to do the little things or do anything. I want them to be maintained there.

01:52:42.000 --> 01:52:48.000
