01:54:26.000 --> 01:54:41.000
pretty well regarded implant organization, and my… my… I gave the closing lecture, and it was all about the future of our patients that we treat. It's really taking good care of them, and so the Dean of Stony Brook asked me to write an article on commitment.

01:54:41.000 --> 01:55:04.000
