01:55:42.000 --> 01:56:01.000
I love AI. Everyone hear me say that. I love it. But I don't love it for this. I think that I think that when our dental offices feel like they are too busy to pick up the phone and call the patients that they have let walk out the door.

01:56:01.000 --> 01:56:14.000
we are… we've lost an opportunity. And the way I always explain this to teams is that, and to doctors, I look at the value that they spend, I look at all the money they're spending on marketing.

01:56:14.000 --> 01:56:22.000
