01:56:44.000 --> 01:57:05.000
And I know those statistics, like, the back of my hand. And it's so important to still have that connection, to be able to hear your team smiling from behind the phone. Without that, your patient retention is just not going… you're wasting money marketing. So we could talk marketing all day long, but if you're not going to retain your patients and get on the phone.

01:57:05.000 --> 01:57:15.000
When you realize that there's a leak. The text message blast and all of those really cool tools that we have, they're not necessarily going to pick up the Slack for us.

